{
  "name": "Contact Form → Welcome Email (Bird)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Contact Form → Welcome Email\n\nAn n8n form captures a sign-up and Bird sends the welcome email straight away.\n\n**Bird operations:** `email › send`",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-460, -80],
      "name": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Setup\n\n1. Add your **Bird API** credential. The key's region prefix (`bk_eu1_…`) selects the API host — there is nothing else to configure.\n2. Replace the **From** address with a sender on a domain you have verified in Bird.\n3. The key needs the `email` scope.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-460, 200],
      "name": "Setup Instructions"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Join the mailing list",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Email",
              "fieldType": "email",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "First Name",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "name": "New Subscriber",
      "webhookId": ""
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "email",
        "operation": "send",
        "from": "Goldcrest <hello@goldcrest.example>",
        "to": "={{ $json[\"Email\"] }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "subject": "=Welcome aboard, {{ $json[\"First Name\"] }}",
          "text": "=Hi {{ $json[\"First Name\"] }},\n\nThanks for signing up. We send one short email a month, and you can unsubscribe from any of them.\n\n— The Goldcrest team"
        }
      },
      "type": "@messagebird/n8n-nodes-bird.bird",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 0],
      "name": "Send Welcome Email",
      "credentials": {
        "birdApi": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "Bird account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "New Subscriber": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Welcome Email",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
